    Two Oregon tight ends turned the 2026 NFL Combine into a highlight reel. Kenyon Sadiq ran the fastest 40-yard dash ever recorded by a tight end. Teammate Eli Stowers jumped higher than any tight end has in over two decades. Here's what both numbers mean.
  </p>
