</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="elite"><td>Eli Stowers (2026, best TE mark since 2003)</td><td>45.5"</td></tr>
<tr><td>Good TE vertical (NFL level)</td><td>Mid-to-high 30s</td></tr>
<tr><td>Excellent TE vertical (NFL level)</td><td>38"+</td></tr>
<tr class="fast"><td>Historically elite (any position)</td><td>40"+</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Stowers also tested well in short-area quickness and broad jump, rounding out a combine that pushed his draft stock into first-round conversation — a significant jump for a tight end prospect, given how rarely the position goes early.</p>
